# boolean-composition-cross-lib foreign library (#189 Slice 0c)
library "Sib".

// "Sib Flag" is a TOTAL scalar boolean (a `defined as exists` over a `coded from` records concept) that the
// root composes over cross-library: `defined as ( "Sib"."Sib Flag" and "Root Flag" )`. Sib carries a decision
// (no `code is`), so it stays a SINGLE-LAYER `none` library named "Sib" — the foreign operand a real cross-lib
// composition references (a cross-library ref into an auto-SPLIT library is a separate unsupported slice).

concept "Sib Cond":
- type is Condition.
- shape is RecordSet.
- coded from "Sib VS".

concept "Sib Flag":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- defined as exists ( "Sib Cond" ).

terminology "Sib VS":
- valueset is `urn:sib-vs`.

activity "Sib Refer":
- request CPGServiceRequest.

decision "Sib Triage":
- when "Sib Flag" then recommend activity "Sib Refer".
